      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>An immense, steely-looking scorpion that bursts out of ambush to sting those traveling through the forests in which it lives. - Imban</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 10, flat-footed 19 (+2 Dex, +11 natural, -2 size)</p><p>hp 95 [130] (10d8+50)</p><p>Fort +12, Ref +5, Will +5</p><p>Immune mind-affecting effects</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 50 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 claws +13 (1d8+8 plus grab), sting +13 (1d8+8 plus poison)</p><p>Space 15 ft.; Reach 15 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks constrict (1d8+8), Sudden Strike</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 27, Dex 15, Con 20, Int —, Wis 14, Cha 2</p><p>Base Atk +7; CMB +17 (+21 grapple); CMD 29 (41 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Skill Focus (Stealth)*</p><p>Skills Perception +6, Stealth +5 (+13 in forests); Racial Modifiers +4 Perception, +8 Stealth (+16 in forests)</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Environment forests</p><p>Organization small group (1-3)</p><p>Treasure incidental</p>"
